{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-js","path":"/blog/2024-12-10-how-to-use-bootstrap-tooltip-in-react-js/","result":{"data":{"markdownRemark":{"excerpt":"Hi Friends 👋, Welcome To aHoisting! To use bootstrap tooltip, you have to import  and tooltip from  than you have pass  component into   attribut use bootstrap…","html":"<p>Hi Friends 👋,</p>\n<p>Welcome To aHoisting!</p>\n<p>To use bootstrap tooltip, you have to import <code class=\"language-text\">OverlayTrigger</code> and tooltip from <code class=\"language-text\">reate-bootstrap</code> than you have pass <code class=\"language-text\">tooltip</code> component into  <code class=\"language-text\">OverlayTrigger</code> attribut use bootstrap tooltip in react js.</p>\n<p>Today, I am going to show you, how to use bootstrap tooltip in react js.</p>\n<h2>Installation</h2>\n<p>Install the following packages to use react-bootstrap in react js.</p>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">npm</code></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\">npm install react<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>bootstrap bootstrap</code></pre></div>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">yarn</code></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\">yarn install react<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>bootstrap bootstrap\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Table of contents</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Install and create a new React app.</li>\n<li>Import react component.</li>\n<li>Create a Component.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Let’s start with the first step.</p>\n<h2>Step 1: Install and create a new React app.</h2>\n<p>First you have to install the React project. You should use <code class=\"language-text\">create-react-app</code> command to create a new React project.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\">npx create<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>react<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>app my<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>app\ncd my<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>app\nnpm start</code></pre></div>\n<h2>Step 2: Import react component.</h2>\n<p>After installing, you have to import your React component.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> React <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'react'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> Button <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'react-bootstrap/Button'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> OverlayTrigger <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'react-bootstrap/OverlayTrigger'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> Tooltip <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'react-bootstrap/Tooltip'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"token string\">'bootstrap/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<h2>Step 3: Create a Component.</h2>\n<p>You can use <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;Tooltip id=\"tooltip-top\"></code> to use bootstrap tooltip in react js.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>div style<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">margin</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">'50px'</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n  <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>OverlayTrigger\n    placement<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"top\"</span>\n    overlay<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>Tooltip id<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"tooltip-top\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>This is a tooltip<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>Tooltip<span class=\"token operator\">></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n  <span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n    <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>Button variant<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"primary\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>Hover over me<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>Button<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>OverlayTrigger<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span></code></pre></div>\n<h2>Use bootstrap tooltip example.</h2>\n<p>The below code is an example of a React. you have to import <code class=\"language-text\">OverlayTrigger</code> and tooltip from <code class=\"language-text\">reate-bootstrap</code> than you have pass<code class=\"language-text\">tooltip</code> component into  <code class=\"language-text\">OverlayTrigger</code> attribut to use bootstrap tooltip in react js.</p>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">App.js</code></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> React <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'react'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> Button <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'react-bootstrap/Button'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> OverlayTrigger <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'react-bootstrap/OverlayTrigger'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> Tooltip <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'react-bootstrap/Tooltip'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"token string\">'bootstrap/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">App</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>div style<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">margin</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">'50px'</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>OverlayTrigger\n        placement<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"top\"</span>\n        overlay<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>Tooltip id<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"tooltip-top\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>This is a tooltip<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>Tooltip<span class=\"token operator\">></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n      <span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n        <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>Button variant<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"primary\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>Hover over me<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>Button<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>OverlayTrigger<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n    <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">default</span> App<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>In the above code example, I have used the <code class=\"language-text\">tooltip</code> component to use bootstrap tooltip in react js.</p>\n<p>Check the output of the above code.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 354px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/54753b6ab27f9d36d10bcfecf38307a2/7d039/bootstrap-tooltip.webp\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 108.22784810126582%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/webp;base64,UklGRnIAAABXRUJQVlA4IGYAAADwAwCdASoUABYAPtFYpk0oJSOiMBgIAQAaCWMAygAN0y1w7j+EPziAAMyj3l8WBHQcBHR8x4qFJBPEYpkCpym9cRs5Om+w+Aky2lrIkJzdkufbNNq+7WyBtGLUHTrsEfsCUtAAAAA='); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"React, bootstrap, tooltip\"\n        title=\"React, bootstrap, tooltip\"\n        src=\"/static/54753b6ab27f9d36d10bcfecf38307a2/7d039/bootstrap-tooltip.webp\"\n        srcset=\"/static/54753b6ab27f9d36d10bcfecf38307a2/81b7c/bootstrap-tooltip.webp 158w,\n/static/54753b6ab27f9d36d10bcfecf38307a2/6ea66/bootstrap-tooltip.webp 315w,\n/static/54753b6ab27f9d36d10bcfecf38307a2/7d039/bootstrap-tooltip.webp 354w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 354px) 100vw, 354px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>All the best 👍</p>","frontmatter":{"title":"How to use bootstrap tooltip in react js?","tags":["React"],"date":"December 10, 2024","description":"Example of use bootstrap tooltip in react js with step by step tutorial - aHoisting","social_image":{"absolutePath":"/Users/mac/Documents/hoisting/ahoisting/static/media/template/reactjs.jpg"}}},"prev":{"frontmatter":{"title":"How to use bcrypt in react js?"},"fields":{"slug":"/blog/2024-12-10-how-to-use-bcrypt-in-react-js/"}},"next":{"frontmatter":{"title":"How to use anchor tag in react js?"},"fields":{"slug":"/blog/2024-12-09-how-to-use-anchor-tag-in-react-js/"}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/blog/2024-12-10-how-to-use-bootstrap-tooltip-in-react-js/","prevSlug":"/blog/2024-12-10-how-to-use-bcrypt-in-react-js/","nextSlug":"/blog/2024-12-09-how-to-use-anchor-tag-in-react-js/"}},"staticQueryHashes":["2555585279","2714594843","3159585216"]}